    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/855f020df51e0e415d727f7784d1e2f7.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/855f020df51e0e415d727f7784d1e2f7.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/855f020df51e0e415d727f7784d1e2f7.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A NEW AND EXCITING ACTION PUZZLE EXPERIENCE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Kyubu Kyubu Dice</i>, an easy-to-learn yet hard-to-master action puzzle game! Roll your magical dice and match the colors with the panels that appear on the stage. Each roll challenges your quick thinking and ability to plan ahead as the game becomes more intense the longer you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suitable for players of all ages, you can play solo or compete with friends in multiplayer mode! Test your spatial thinking and challenge yourself as you carefully plan each move. With a variety of game modes to explore, there's always a fresh way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/8aff0b4b216abc735a332de5778795da.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/8aff0b4b216abc735a332de5778795da.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/8aff0b4b216abc735a332de5778795da.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CAST OF UNIQUE CHARACTERS TO CHOOSE FROM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring a vibrant cast of appealing characters, each designed in a charming anime style to match the game's aesthetic. From the energetic and cheerful to the cool and mysterious, every character brings their own personality to the stage. To make the experience even more immersive, all characters are fully voiced in Japanese, enhancing the authentic anime-inspired feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/c16ab72bb20dedf113a0237810643362.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/c16ab72bb20dedf113a0237810643362.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/c16ab72bb20dedf113a0237810643362.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMPETITIVE MULTIPLAYER!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to challenge your friends and show them who\u2019s the best? Jump into multiplayer modes where quick thinking and clever plays make all the difference! Battle it out in head-to-head matches or compete for high scores. Whether you\u2019re aiming for the top of the leaderboards or just having fun with friends, there\u2019s a mode for every kind of player. Try different rulesets and strategies\u2014no two matches are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/7b3ab83552638ea7e0ce17ac159f55cd.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/7b3ab83552638ea7e0ce17ac159f55cd.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/7b3ab83552638ea7e0ce17ac159f55cd.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW FOR MORE UPDATES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kyubu Kyubu Dice</i> is still in development, so you can expect <strong>a lot more content</strong> at launch! Make sure to wishlist and follow the game so you don't miss any updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always remember \u2014 <strong>you\u2019re the best!</strong> \ud83c\udfb2\ud83d\udcab</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/855f020df51e0e415d727f7784d1e2f7.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/855f020df51e0e415d727f7784d1e2f7.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/855f020df51e0e415d727f7784d1e2f7.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A NEW AND EXCITING ACTION PUZZLE EXPERIENCE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Kyubu Kyubu Dice</i>, an easy-to-learn yet hard-to-master action puzzle game! Roll your magical dice and match the colors with the panels that appear on the stage. Each roll challenges your quick thinking and ability to plan ahead as the game becomes more intense the longer you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suitable for players of all ages, you can play solo or compete with friends in multiplayer mode! Test your spatial thinking and challenge yourself as you carefully plan each move. With a variety of game modes to explore, there's always a fresh way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/8aff0b4b216abc735a332de5778795da.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/8aff0b4b216abc735a332de5778795da.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/8aff0b4b216abc735a332de5778795da.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CAST OF UNIQUE CHARACTERS TO CHOOSE FROM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring a vibrant cast of appealing characters, each designed in a charming anime style to match the game's aesthetic. From the energetic and cheerful to the cool and mysterious, every character brings their own personality to the stage. To make the experience even more immersive, all characters are fully voiced in Japanese, enhancing the authentic anime-inspired feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/c16ab72bb20dedf113a0237810643362.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/c16ab72bb20dedf113a0237810643362.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/c16ab72bb20dedf113a0237810643362.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMPETITIVE MULTIPLAYER!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to challenge your friends and show them who\u2019s the best? Jump into multiplayer modes where quick thinking and clever plays make all the difference! Battle it out in head-to-head matches or compete for high scores. Whether you\u2019re aiming for the top of the leaderboards or just having fun with friends, there\u2019s a mode for every kind of player. Try different rulesets and strategies\u2014no two matches are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/7b3ab83552638ea7e0ce17ac159f55cd.poster.avif?t=1753993106\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/7b3ab83552638ea7e0ce17ac159f55cd.webm?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120220/extras/7b3ab83552638ea7e0ce17ac159f55cd.mp4?t=1753993106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW FOR MORE UPDATES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Kyubu Kyubu Dice</i> is still in development, so you can expect <strong>a lot more content</strong> at launch! Make sure to wishlist and follow the game so you don't miss any updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always remember \u2014 <strong>you\u2019re the best!</strong> \ud83c\udfb2\ud83d\udcab</p>",
